# Build output
build/

# Bundled toolchain (~300MB; re-fetch with: bash setup.sh)
toolchain/

# Game assets from upstream repo (pjsk sprites / SE; re-fetch with: bash setup.sh)
# Tracked in full since 2026-09-12: the old "assets/*" + re-include rules
# silently dropped hand-curated sprites (select / fx / ui / splashscreen) on
# every git add. setup.sh still restores assets/mmw if it ever goes missing.

# Downloaded charts & audio (official game data; personal use only)
charts/

# Player data: settings + play results (written next to charts/). Ignored on
# purpose - it is per-player state, not source. Copy this file to a new machine
# together with charts/ to keep the records (scores are keyed by chart name).
userdata.json

# Per-user profiles (settings / scores / account per player, 2026-09-16).
# Same reasoning as userdata.json: this is someone's save, not source.
profiles/

# Downloader settings (chartdl.json sits next to chartdl.exe)
chartdl.json

# Release staging + archives (made by: bash package.sh)
dist/

# Local runtime artifacts
*.log
*.pdb
imgui.ini

# Scratch screenshots from --screenshot runs (see AGENTS.md "验证")
.workbuddy/shots/
# Local backups of pre-shrink assets (the originals also live in git history).
.workbuddy/backup/

# Python bytecode from the .workbuddy/tools helpers
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Linux 构建产物
build-linux/
build/
*.o
*.a

# 备份
.bak-paths/

# 用户数据（profile）
profiles/
charts/
userdata.json

# 下载器输出
downloader/CMakeCache.txt
downloader/CMakeFiles/
downloader/cmake_install.cmake
downloader/Makefile
downloader/cppsekai-chartdl

# AUR 构建残留（makepkg 的 src/ / pkg/ 与打好的包）。
# 别提交：aur/src 里是解压出来的源码，套着上一版的 aur/，会一层层变大。
aur/src/
aur/pkg/
aur/*.tar.gz
aur/*.pkg.tar.zst
